  "title": "Nexxen to Host Investor Day on June 16, 2026",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, May 12, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Nexxen International Ltd. (NASDAQ: NEXN) (“Nexxen” or the “Company”), the advertising technology platform powered by unique data and media, today announced it will host an Investor Day in New York City on Tuesday, June 16, 2026.",
